tive) this or that; occasionally (instead of copula) as or are","kjv_def":"he, as for her, him(-self), it, the same, she (herself), such, that (...it), these, they, this, those, which (is), who.","n":34,"o":"GEN2:11 GEN2:12 GEN2:19 GEN3:6 GEN3:12 GEN4:4 GEN4:26 GEN14:2 GEN14:3 GEN14:8 GEN14:17 GEN15:2 GEN15:18 GEN19:20 GEN19:35 GEN19:37 GEN20:5 EXO1:10 EXO6:26 NUM5:31 NUM11:3 NUM35:19 DEU3:13 JOS10:13 1SA1:3 1SA30:20 1KI3:4 1KI10:10 2KI8:22 JOB39:30 ECC2:22 ISA9:15 JER29:28 EZK30:18"},"H1932":{"lemma":"הוּא","xlit":"hûwʼ","pron":"hoo","derivation":"(Aramaic) or (feminine) הִיא; (Aramaic), corresponding to H1931 (הוּא)","strongs_def":"{he (she or it); self, or (especially with the article) the same; sometimes (as demonstrative) this or that; occasionally (instead of copula) as or are}","kjv_def":"[idiom] are, it, this.","n":7,"o":"EZR6:15 DAN2:9 DAN2:20 DAN2:44 DAN4:24 DAN4:30 DAN7:7"},"H1933":{"lemma":"הָוָא","xlit":"hâvâʼ","pron":"haw-vaw'","derivation":"or הָוָה; a primitive root (compare H183 (אָוָה), H1961 (הָיָה)) supposed to mean properly, to breathe;","strongs_def":"to be (in the sense of existence)","kjv_def":"be, [idiom] have.","n":6,"o":"GEN27:29 NEH6:6 JOB37:6 ECC2:22 ECC11:3 ISA16:4"},"H1934":{"lemma":"הָוָא","xlit":"hâvâʼ","pron":"hav-aw'","derivation":"(Aramaic) or הָוָה; (Aramaic), corresponding to H1933 (הָוָא);","strongs_def":"to exist; used in a great variety of applications (especially in connection with other words)","kjv_def":"be, become, [phrase] behold, [phrase] came (to pass), [phrase] cease, [phrase] cleave, [phrase] consider, [phrase] do, [phrase] give, [phrase] have, [phrase] judge, [phrase] keep, [phrase] labour, [phrase] mingle (self), [phrase] put, [phrase] see, [phrase] seek, [phrase] set, [phrase] slay, [phrase] take heed, tremble, [phrase] walk, [phrase] would.","n":51,"o":"EZR4:12 EZR4:20 EZR4:22 EZR4:24 EZR5:5 EZR5:8 EZR5:11 EZR6:6 EZR6:8 EZR6:9 EZR6:10 EZR7:23 EZR7:25 EZR7:26 DAN2:20 DAN2:28 DAN2:29 DAN2:31 DAN2:35 DAN2:40 DAN2:41